1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 40=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:44,319 --> 00:01:44,799
A cricket?

7
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:45,640
That's it?

8
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:48,519
The Lin family's Third Young Madam

9
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:50,560
gave the Fourth Young Lady a cricket.

10
00:01:50,719 --> 00:01:51,840
Once word gets out,

11
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:54,439
it'll be quite the tale in Jinling City.

12
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:55,079
Exactly.

13
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,184
That's hardly a proper gift.

14
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,120
I told you to prepare a dowry gift,

15
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:02,079
and you got me a cricket?

16
00:02:03,079 --> 00:02:03,840
What's going on?

17
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,640
This is no ordinary cricket.

18
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,879
It's a Matou King.

19
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,800
If we sold it,

20
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,800
it'd fetch at least sixty gold.

21
00:02:12,479 --> 00:02:13,159
What rubbish!

22
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:14,240
All right.

23
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:14,919
That's enough.

24
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:18,199
Today is Xiushu's happy day.

25
00:02:18,439 --> 00:02:19,520
Both of you, say no more.

26
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,639
Say no more.

27
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:21,400
Go on, sell it!

28
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:22,240
Go on, sell it!

29
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,439
How did I end up marrying
such a useless man?

30
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:26,120
Get me back my sixty gold!

31
00:02:26,130 --> 00:02:27,560
- You lost your post!
- It's all right.

32
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,460
And we have no money!

33
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:29,879
Besides humiliating me,

34
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,599
what else can you do?

35
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,280
Son!

36
00:02:34,008 --> 00:02:36,630
- There are many people here.
- It's all your useless father's fault.

37
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:37,159
Let go of me!

38
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:40,159
The Lin family claims Young Master Lin

39
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,879
resigned to come home and be filial.

40
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,479
Who'd be that foolish?

41
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,280
Giving up a high post in the capital

42
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,439
to sit idle at home?

43
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,319
He must have lost His Majesty's favor

44
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:49,919
and come slinking back.

45
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,360
And this Third Young Master Lin

46
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,120
never had any real ability.

47
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,639
Once his backer fell,

48
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:56,039
his colleagues pushed him out,

49
00:02:56,159 --> 00:02:57,240
and he lost his post.

50
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,960
Doesn't the Lin family still have

51
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,304
Marquis Yongchang as a son-in-law?

52
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:03,520
Just look.

53
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:05,400
With that whole string of daughters,

54
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:08,080
the Third Young Lady is overwhelmed,

55
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:10,120
let alone helping her own family.

56
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:11,240
No wonder.

57
00:03:12,439 --> 00:03:13,199
I heard

58
00:03:14,312 --> 00:03:15,630
she was once in marriage talks

59
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:18,120
with Duke Xiangguo's grandson.

60
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,039
She was to marry into a duke's family,

61
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:22,280
and then suddenly it all fell through.

62
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,520
So

63
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:25,800
Third Young Madam Lin crying now

64
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,319
is rather fitting.

65
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,800
What did you say?

66
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,800
What about me?

67
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,919
What about you?

68
00:03:33,240 --> 00:03:34,719
Come on, say that again!

69
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,840
You want a fight?

70
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,360
So what if I hit you?

71
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,719
Mother, let go of me!

72
00:03:39,199 --> 00:03:40,000
Say it again!

73
00:03:40,010 --> 00:03:40,890
Come on, say it again!

74
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:41,719
Say it!

75
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,319
I did say it.

76
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,280
What are you going to do?

77
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:44,319
Say no more.

78
00:03:44,719 --> 00:03:45,240
Say no more.

79
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:46,319
You want a fight?

80
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:47,800
So what if I hit you?

81
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:49,080
Mother, let go of me!

82
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,520
Say it again!

83
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,199
Come on, say it again! Say it!

84
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:53,719
Keep going!

85
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:54,680
You unfilial girl!

86
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,159
Once a creature of the wild grass,

87
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:58,328
I've now risen to the great hall.

88
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:02,199
I'll never forget my wise lord's favor.

89
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:05,840
Well fed in my jar, I stay sharp.

90
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,680
Fierce in the ring, I crush the strong.

91
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:12,599
His Majesty is fond of crickets.

92
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:16,079
A palace eunuch, at His Majesty's order,

93
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:19,079
wrote this poem especially for crickets,

94
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:22,839
using them to voice lofty ambitions.

95
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,079
No wonder the poem sounds so good.

96
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:28,519
So it came from the palace.

97
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:32,079
A fine poem.

98
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,759
A fine poem indeed.

99
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:36,600
Now Jinqiao has given me a cricket,

100
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:39,319
surely to encourage Third Master Yang

101
00:04:39,519 --> 00:04:42,439
to honor royal favor like this cricket

102
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:43,870
and always strive to better himself.

103
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,040
With this gift,

104
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,319
let's all strive for this together.

105
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:48,439
Yes.

106
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:50,519
- Together.
- Together.

107
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:52,319
Together.

108
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:02,079
The Cheng family is steeped in learning,

109
00:05:02,439 --> 00:05:04,079
and you're quite literary, Fengxian.

110
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,720
You must have heard this poem, right?

111
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:09,879
Yes, I have.

112
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,279
It's a fine poem.

113
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,839
One more thing.

114
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,839
His Majesty has sent palace eunuchs

115
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,920
to collect crickets among the people.

116
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,720
Any cricket chosen for tribute

117
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:23,279
wins a hundred gold and official rank.

118
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:24,639
Well...

119
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,928
So it really is worth sixty gold.

120
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:28,240
One cricket can win an official post?

121
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,920
It's absolutely true.

122
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,720
Sister Niu, if you don't believe me,

123
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,240
go ask your husband.

124
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:38,000
To curry favor with the Second Prince's

125
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,279
- palace eunuchs,
- I...

126
00:05:40,079 --> 00:05:41,600
he asked me just last month

127
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,879
where to find a good cricket like this.

128
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,639
That never happened.

129
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:01,199
Why did she have to be a servant?

130
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:25,240
No wonder Fengtai insisted on Lanxiang.

131
00:06:26,959 --> 00:06:28,240
In this world, a few words

132
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,439
that can settle a dispute

133
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:30,600
are rare indeed.

134
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:32,439
But rarer still

135
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,399
is claiming no credit for it.

136
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,319
Because of me today,

137
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:43,319
Xiuru and my wife were both wronged.

138
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:50,120
No wonder those ignorant women gossip.

139
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:52,920
But I don't understand it either.

140
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,040
Why would you give up

141
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:57,319
real power as Left Chief Commander
of the Rear Military Command

142
00:06:58,040 --> 00:07:00,120
and insist on resigning to Jinling?

143
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:04,480
Then His Majesty cut military spending,

144
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,920
so there's still no real post for you,

145
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:09,680
and you're left idle at home.

146
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:18,319
I'm the eldest grandson.

147
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:21,079
Since childhood, Grandfather

148
00:07:21,300 --> 00:07:23,000
and the family have
had high hopes for me.

149
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,879
I was always pushed forward,

150
00:07:26,839 --> 00:07:29,639
thinking only of getting ahead.

151
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,279
It's rare to have some peaceful days

152
00:07:32,439 --> 00:07:34,160
to be still and ask

153
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:35,439
myself

154
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,360
which path I truly want to take,

155
00:07:42,439 --> 00:07:43,480
and which way to follow.

156
00:07:46,959 --> 00:07:48,399
Getting ahead,

157
00:07:48,872 --> 00:07:50,360
bringing glory to one's ancestors...

158
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:53,079
What's wrong with that?

159
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,439
Shouldn't a man seek rank and riches

160
00:07:56,792 --> 00:07:58,310
and win honors for his wife and sons?

161
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,839
Jinqi.

162
00:08:06,439 --> 00:08:07,240
Jinqiao.

163
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,790
I've found a great way to make money.

164
00:08:09,816 --> 00:08:11,350
I want to discuss it with you, Jinqi.

165
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:13,360
Shaohui, help me think it through, too.

166
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:17,920
What is it?

167
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,319
All I need is a ship

168
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,839
and a merchant license.

169
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,759
I ship silk and porcelain from Jiangnan

170
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:24,879
to Quanzhou,

171
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,232
and make several times the profit.

172
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:28,680
So if I put in a thousand taels,

173
00:08:28,839 --> 00:08:30,120
I'll make several thousand.

174
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,759
Do you know

175
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:37,279
who buys the silk and porcelain?

176
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:39,919
Who cares who buys it?

177
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:40,960
In business,

178
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,480
all that matters is selling the goods.

179
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,519
The court enforces a maritime ban.

180
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:46,279
Apart from tribute missions,

181
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:48,480
trade with foreigners is forbidden.

182
00:08:48,759 --> 00:08:50,879
The buyers who'd make you that profit

183
00:08:51,279 --> 00:08:52,879
are those very foreigners.

184
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:54,960
Right.

185
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,840
Fujian has few fields and rough terrain.

186
00:08:58,279 --> 00:09:00,440
People rely on Zhejiang and Guangdong,

187
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:02,240
shipping rice in by sea,

188
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,320
just to scrape by.

189
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,720
Yet some take the risk

190
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:08,559
of shipping silk and porcelain

191
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:10,519
from Jiangnan to Quanzhou

192
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,200
and selling it to foreigners in secret

193
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:14,919
for many times the profit.

194
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:16,399
But if caught,

195
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:22,320
by law, a hundred strokes or beheading.

196
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,159
This fortune...

197
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:28,919
do you still want to make it?

198
00:09:30,559 --> 00:09:31,200
No.

199
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:32,039
Not anymore.

200
00:09:33,159 --> 00:09:35,039
Jinqi, forget I said anything.

201
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,399
I'm off.

202
00:09:40,799 --> 00:09:41,600
Jinqiao.

203
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,039
Because I resigned,

204
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,879
you lost your post.

205
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,639
Do you blame me?

206
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,240
I only got that post

207
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:04,039
thanks to you in the first place.

208
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:05,159
I wasn't capable enough

209
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:05,960
to keep it.

210
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,440
How is that your fault?

211
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:10,039
Jinqi, you've never called me useless,

212
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:12,080
so how could I blame you?

213
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:14,360
Jinqi,

214
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:16,919
don't overthink it.

215
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,080
I'm meeting a friend.

216
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,879
Jinqiao has a pure heart.

217
00:10:32,879 --> 00:10:33,879
Having a brother like him

218
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,399
is a blessing for you and me.

219
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,440
In the past,

220
00:10:41,528 --> 00:10:42,550
I could have found Jinqiao

221
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:44,120
a post in the army.

222
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,480
But now, troops are cut everywhere.

223
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:50,519
Don't worry about Jinqiao's post.

224
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,919
He won't starve anytime soon.

225
00:10:56,039 --> 00:10:57,720
As long as not having a son

226
00:10:58,879 --> 00:11:00,120
doesn't make you resent Xiuru,

227
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,200
Jinqiao and I

228
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,840
will be content.

229
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,480
Fengtai.

230
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,440
I told you before,

231
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:17,096
it was because I valued your character

232
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:19,279
that I sought to join our two families.

233
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:22,039
How could I ever break my word?

234
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:28,279
Besides, Xiuru is still young.

235
00:11:28,936 --> 00:11:30,390
She'll have a son sooner or later.

236
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,240
"You're still young,

237
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:39,080
and a son will come sooner or later?"

238
00:11:39,559 --> 00:11:41,679
Stop trying to fool me!

239
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,440
You're thirty-nine,

240
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:49,480
nearly forty.

241
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,480
She's twenty-six

242
00:11:52,919 --> 00:11:55,720
and had three useless girls in a row.

243
00:11:57,240 --> 00:12:00,240
Must I go to my grave

244
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,440
still longing for a grandson?

245
00:12:05,679 --> 00:12:07,200
Mother, don't make yourself ill.

246
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,480
Mother, please calm down.

247
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,720
Have some water for your throat.

248
00:12:16,159 --> 00:12:17,519
It's all my fault.

249
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,919
If you know you're at fault,

250
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:22,200
have you considered

251
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,279
what you should do

252
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:28,039
as a wife of the Marquis's house?

253
00:12:28,879 --> 00:12:29,840
I don't know.

254
00:12:30,679 --> 00:12:32,000
Please guide me, Mother.

255
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:34,720
Since you can't give him a son,

256
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,279
you should

257
00:12:36,559 --> 00:12:38,399
find your husband a concubine soon

258
00:12:38,519 --> 00:12:39,879
so he'll have a son soon.

259
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:43,200
That's what a virtuous wife does!

260
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,679
Mother, I...

261
00:12:51,919 --> 00:12:52,519
Mother,

262
00:12:54,039 --> 00:12:55,480
give Xiuru one more chance.

263
00:12:55,864 --> 00:12:56,440
We'll surely...

264
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,360
Must you drive me to my death

265
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:00,039
before you'll agree?

266
00:13:00,039 --> 00:13:00,919
No, I...

267
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,159
By court law,

268
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:07,679
officials can't wed freeborn concubines.

269
00:13:08,279 --> 00:13:09,759
But women bought from outside

270
00:13:10,159 --> 00:13:11,480
have unknown backgrounds.

271
00:13:11,679 --> 00:13:12,840
I don't trust them.

272
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:15,159
She must come from a clean background

273
00:13:15,639 --> 00:13:17,240
and have a gentle nature.

274
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:19,399
After much thought,

275
00:13:20,759 --> 00:13:23,000
only Biwu is truly reliable.

276
00:13:25,220 --> 00:13:26,919
(Biwu, Old Madam Yuan's head maid,
daughter of Yuan family's head butler)

277
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:27,720
Mother!

278
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,480
Biwu's father

279
00:13:31,279 --> 00:13:33,120
is our household's head butler.

280
00:13:33,559 --> 00:13:36,200
A fortune-teller cast Biwu's chart.

281
00:13:36,519 --> 00:13:39,480
She's fated to bear sons and bring luck.

282
00:13:40,639 --> 00:13:41,440
Mother!

283
00:13:43,919 --> 00:13:44,720
Blood?

284
00:13:45,519 --> 00:13:46,200
Mother!

285
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:48,440
Rest for a while.

286
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:54,360
You...

287
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,360
Will you agree?

288
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:57,039
I...

289
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:02,799
Three days from now is a lucky day.

290
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:06,840
We'll hold the concubine ceremony then!

291
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:09,799
If I'm lucky,

292
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:12,840
I may see a grandson before I die,

293
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,679
and then peacefully

294
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:18,480
go join your father below.

295
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:29,639
I agree.

296
00:14:55,559 --> 00:14:57,720
Your Lordship, here's the medicine.

297
00:14:59,039 --> 00:14:59,840
I'll do it.

298
00:15:00,879 --> 00:15:02,559
Biwu, come.

299
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:17,919
Mother.

300
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,600
Silly child.

301
00:16:21,759 --> 00:16:23,120
I'm already soaked.

302
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,720
Don't get yourself wet too.

303
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,799
Even if not for yourself,

304
00:16:44,679 --> 00:16:46,279
then for me and my three sisters,

305
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,879
you mustn't put your body through this.

306
00:16:51,039 --> 00:16:52,279
You're right, Jiarong.

307
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,440
I was wrong.

308
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:58,720
Ever since you married into this family,

309
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,480
you've given your all

310
00:17:00,888 --> 00:17:02,000
serving your mother-in-law

311
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:04,079
and treated me like your own daughter.

312
00:17:04,519 --> 00:17:06,559
You've never done a single thing wrong.

313
00:17:08,079 --> 00:17:10,119
What Third Granduncle and his kin plot,

314
00:17:11,279 --> 00:17:13,680
Grandmother may be too blind to see,

315
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:15,559
but I see it all clearly.

316
00:17:16,279 --> 00:17:17,480
If Biwu's son

317
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,400
inherits the title,

318
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,759
this Yuan household

319
00:17:23,559 --> 00:17:25,519
will fall to Third Granduncle's family.

320
00:17:26,079 --> 00:17:28,599
What place would be left for us sisters?

321
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:38,079
It's my fault.

322
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:39,759
It's all because I

323
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,319
couldn't bear a son.

324
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:43,920
Not only has the Marquis

325
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:45,599
been branded unfilial,

326
00:17:46,559 --> 00:17:49,039
but you girls have no one to rely on.

327
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:50,640
How can that be your fault?

328
00:17:51,599 --> 00:17:53,000
It's Heaven's fault.

329
00:17:54,279 --> 00:17:56,680
Why can't a daughter inherit the title?

330
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,119
You always say

331
00:18:06,319 --> 00:18:07,799
Grandmother is shrewd and capable,

332
00:18:08,519 --> 00:18:10,279
and Aunt Lanxiang is wise and gracious.

333
00:18:10,728 --> 00:18:12,240
Why don't we go to the Lin Residence

334
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:15,079
and ask them to think of something?

335
00:18:21,820 --> 00:18:25,020
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

336
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:28,359
When Jiaming was born,

337
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,119
I reminded you

338
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:32,279
to find the Marquis a concubine.

339
00:18:33,319 --> 00:18:35,480
But you held too dear
the love you shared

340
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,720
and would not give him up.

341
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:39,720
You claimed the Marquis said

342
00:18:40,039 --> 00:18:41,079
court officials

343
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:43,279
must be sonless at forty to take one.

344
00:18:43,839 --> 00:18:45,119
Didn't you stop to think

345
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:47,839
how few officials really keep that rule?

346
00:18:49,559 --> 00:18:50,720
And now look.

347
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:53,599
The Yuan clan has you by the throat.

348
00:18:54,079 --> 00:18:55,559
Your mother-in-law resents you,

349
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,720
and you're called a jealous wife.

350
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:59,799
We can't blame the Third Young Lady.

351
00:19:00,720 --> 00:19:02,599
We were all young once.

352
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:04,599
Who hasn't had her illusions,

353
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,720
holding such paltry love

354
00:19:09,039 --> 00:19:10,720
dearer than all the world?

355
00:19:18,119 --> 00:19:19,519
Not one man is any good.

356
00:19:21,279 --> 00:19:22,319
You're an unmarried girl.

357
00:19:22,319 --> 00:19:23,359
What are you doing here?

358
00:19:23,519 --> 00:19:24,799
This isn't for your ears.

359
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:25,720
Get out, now.

360
00:19:25,759 --> 00:19:26,759
Why can't I listen?

361
00:19:27,519 --> 00:19:28,240
These things

362
00:19:28,599 --> 00:19:30,440
should be made clear to a woman

363
00:19:30,519 --> 00:19:31,759
before she marries,

364
00:19:31,832 --> 00:19:33,440
so she doesn't reach her husband's home

365
00:19:33,799 --> 00:19:34,839
still clueless.

366
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:37,039
With that wild temper of yours,

367
00:19:37,119 --> 00:19:38,359
no one will marry you.

368
00:19:38,519 --> 00:19:39,400
Listening is pointless.

369
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:40,559
Go back, now.

370
00:19:40,648 --> 00:19:41,960
All the better if no one does.

371
00:19:43,119 --> 00:19:43,839
See?

372
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:50,640
Xiuru.

373
00:19:51,559 --> 00:19:52,480
What do you

374
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,200
really want?

375
00:19:57,559 --> 00:19:57,960
I...

376
00:20:00,839 --> 00:20:01,400
I...

377
00:20:02,519 --> 00:20:04,480
You have to tell us the truth

378
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:06,720
so we can help you find a way.

379
00:20:08,279 --> 00:20:09,119
Xiuru,

380
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,880
speak freely.

381
00:20:17,119 --> 00:20:19,720
I don't want him taking a concubine.

382
00:20:29,119 --> 00:20:30,519
Forgive me, I'm powerless.

383
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:32,000
However capable I may be,

384
00:20:32,279 --> 00:20:34,519
I can't help you end the Yuan bloodline.

385
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,359
You'll have

386
00:20:36,759 --> 00:20:37,960
to manage on your own.

387
00:20:39,559 --> 00:20:40,359
Shunhua.

388
00:20:41,039 --> 00:20:41,839
Shunhua.

389
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:42,759
Shunhua.

390
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:45,720
Shunhua.

391
00:20:46,350 --> 00:20:47,688
The Third Young Lady's troubles...

392
00:20:47,784 --> 00:20:49,096
are you really staying out of it?

393
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:51,720
Shunhua.

394
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,880
I knew it.

395
00:20:54,519 --> 00:20:56,119
What we women truly want

396
00:20:56,119 --> 00:20:57,720
counts for nothing.

397
00:20:58,279 --> 00:20:59,640
When family interests are at stake,

398
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,599
who cares whether we women are happy

399
00:21:01,599 --> 00:21:02,519
or willing?

400
00:21:03,319 --> 00:21:05,039
I should never have said it.

401
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:07,880
Now I've angered Mother as well.

402
00:21:10,079 --> 00:21:11,880
You're too heartless.

403
00:21:16,119 --> 00:21:17,359
Xiuru, don't cry.

404
00:21:19,799 --> 00:21:20,599
Lanxiang.

405
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:27,480
Lanxiang.

406
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,240
Please think of something

407
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:31,880
to help Xiuru.

408
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:37,119
Xiuru, don't cry.

409
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:50,279
Stop crying.

410
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,079
Stop crying.

411
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:58,400
I said stop crying.

412
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:59,160
Did you hear me?

413
00:22:05,039 --> 00:22:05,759
Xiuru,

414
00:22:06,839 --> 00:22:08,319
listen to what Lanxiang has to say.

415
00:22:10,119 --> 00:22:12,480
Yes, listen to Lanxiang.

416
00:22:22,119 --> 00:22:23,000
Xiuru.

417
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:25,640
If you don't want Shaohui
to take a concubine,

418
00:22:26,319 --> 00:22:28,599
there's only one way now.

419
00:22:29,559 --> 00:22:30,640
What way?

420
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:33,319
If Shaohui

421
00:22:33,319 --> 00:22:35,319
insists on doing as Old Madam Yuan says

422
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:36,920
and taking Biwu as a concubine,

423
00:22:37,839 --> 00:22:38,960
then separate from him.

424
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,279
I agree.

425
00:22:47,279 --> 00:22:47,960
No.

426
00:22:49,200 --> 00:22:49,920
No.

427
00:22:51,799 --> 00:22:53,440
Shaohui only wants a concubine,

428
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:55,240
and it's for the sake of an heir.

429
00:22:56,319 --> 00:22:57,759
Why go as far as separating?

430
00:22:58,279 --> 00:23:00,039
Besides, there are three children.

431
00:23:01,039 --> 00:23:02,400
If one day they learned

432
00:23:02,632 --> 00:23:04,330
that their mother,
over so small a thing,

433
00:23:04,344 --> 00:23:05,200
had abandoned them,

434
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:07,319
how could they bear it?

435
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,680
Xiulai has a point.

436
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:14,559
The Marquis's house is full of gossip.

437
00:23:15,319 --> 00:23:17,640
Children without a mother have it hard.

438
00:23:23,279 --> 00:23:24,519
What do you think, Xiuru?

439
00:23:35,279 --> 00:23:36,519
I'm too narrow-minded

440
00:23:37,839 --> 00:23:39,720
to be as generous as Mother wants.

441
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:42,480
Rather than suffer day after day,

442
00:23:43,319 --> 00:23:44,839
it's better to end it quickly.

443
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:47,119
I'd rather separate.

444
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:49,319
All right.

445
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:52,240
Since you've made up your mind,

446
00:23:53,119 --> 00:23:54,160
leave the rest

447
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:56,640
to Jinqi and me.

448
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:01,680
Jinqi and the Marquis are close friends.

449
00:24:02,359 --> 00:24:05,119
Would he truly quarrel with him for me?

450
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,079
He would.

451
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:12,920
My mother is gravely ill.
Her days are few.

452
00:24:14,119 --> 00:24:15,119
Her only wish

453
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,079
is to hold a grandson.

454
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:19,240
As her son,

455
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:20,952
I have no choice but to obey.

456
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:24,079
I hope you'll understand, Jinqi.

457
00:24:28,279 --> 00:24:29,079
I understand.

458
00:24:32,319 --> 00:24:33,400
But Xiuru

459
00:24:34,552 --> 00:24:36,296
would rather end it
with her pride intact

460
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,350
than stay married by giving in.

461
00:24:40,260 --> 00:24:42,500
(Separation Agreement)

462
00:24:42,599 --> 00:24:43,359
Separation?

463
00:24:45,359 --> 00:24:46,559
This is absurd.

464
00:24:49,279 --> 00:24:49,960
I won't agree.

465
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:58,240
Xiuru has made up her mind.

466
00:24:58,839 --> 00:25:00,079
Please grant her wish, Chengze.

467
00:25:01,079 --> 00:25:01,799
Old Madam.

468
00:25:06,519 --> 00:25:07,319
Mother.

469
00:25:07,519 --> 00:25:08,240
Aunt.

470
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:10,759
So the Lin family wants a separation?

471
00:25:11,519 --> 00:25:12,000
Yes.

472
00:25:13,599 --> 00:25:14,400
Lin Jinqi.

473
00:25:15,039 --> 00:25:17,319
You're a marquis with no real power,

474
00:25:17,759 --> 00:25:19,680
and your heirs have yet to inherit.

475
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:21,240
Where does the Lin family

476
00:25:21,559 --> 00:25:23,720
get the nerve to cross the Yuan family?

477
00:25:24,519 --> 00:25:25,599
We're not making trouble.

478
00:25:25,928 --> 00:25:27,400
I've invited the neighborhood headman,

479
00:25:27,410 --> 00:25:29,880
officials from the Ministry of War
and the Ministry of Justice

480
00:25:30,119 --> 00:25:31,640
to officiate the separation.

481
00:25:32,296 --> 00:25:33,790
If that's not making trouble, what is?

482
00:25:34,088 --> 00:25:36,280
(Huang Mainiang, wife)
Who invites the Ministry of War

483
00:25:36,350 --> 00:25:38,264
(of the late Marquis Yuan's cousin)
and Justice to officiate a separation?

484
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:40,640
Third Aunt.

485
00:25:41,519 --> 00:25:43,319
My wife is a titled marchioness.

486
00:25:43,799 --> 00:25:44,640
By court law,

487
00:25:44,792 --> 00:25:46,456
any officer's titled wife who separates

488
00:25:46,472 --> 00:25:48,200
must report to the Ministry of War

489
00:25:48,264 --> 00:25:49,624
and the Ministry of Justice

490
00:25:50,039 --> 00:25:50,839
for approval.

491
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:52,759
It was thanks to the Yuan family

492
00:25:53,119 --> 00:25:54,799
that she got that title at all.

493
00:25:55,079 --> 00:25:57,400
And now that Lin woman flaunts her title

494
00:25:57,440 --> 00:25:59,720
to make this the talk of the whole city,

495
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:01,720
bringing shame on the Yuan family.

496
00:26:09,119 --> 00:26:09,799
Old Madam Yuan,

497
00:26:10,519 --> 00:26:11,519
I'll take my leave.

498
00:26:13,559 --> 00:26:14,039
Fengtai.

499
00:26:15,200 --> 00:26:15,680
Fengtai.

500
00:26:16,759 --> 00:26:17,240
Fengtai.

501
00:26:23,384 --> 00:26:24,750
Third Aunt, you know full well

502
00:26:25,160 --> 00:26:27,200
His Majesty used my wedding to Xiuru

503
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,440
as cover to leave Jinling.

504
00:26:28,616 --> 00:26:30,200
Fengtai risked his life to protect him

505
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:32,119
and get him safely back to the capital.

506
00:26:32,488 --> 00:26:33,880
How can you ignore your conscience

507
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:35,240
and say such nonsense?

508
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:38,680
That title, the Lins earned themselves.

509
00:26:42,119 --> 00:26:43,880
Marrying into the Lins was a mistake.

510
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,680
A humble house with small-minded ways.

511
00:26:47,519 --> 00:26:48,599
Separate, then.

512
00:26:49,119 --> 00:26:50,519
The Yuans have no shortage of wives.

513
00:26:50,519 --> 00:26:51,519
They can't separate.

514
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:53,119
Absolutely not.

515
00:26:55,079 --> 00:26:57,039
If they separate over a concubine,

516
00:26:57,039 --> 00:26:59,319
that jealous Lin woman will fare badly,

517
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:02,160
and our family's name will suffer too.

518
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,319
How could that be possible?

519
00:27:05,272 --> 00:27:07,224
Every official at court knows
that His Majesty

520
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:10,440
only ascended the throne safely with
Lin family's help during the wedding.

521
00:27:10,952 --> 00:27:11,750
The Lin family also

522
00:27:11,760 --> 00:27:13,960
rendered meritorious service
in protecting His Majesty.

523
00:27:14,519 --> 00:27:15,920
After marrying into our family,

524
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,920
she bore three daughters in succession.

525
00:27:18,088 --> 00:27:20,664
Even if she earned no merit,
she still endured years of hardship.

526
00:27:21,519 --> 00:27:24,559
Now their marriage
has fallen apart over a concubine.

527
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:28,799
Our Yuan family will surely
face criticism and attacks.

528
00:27:30,039 --> 00:27:31,079
When that happens, my son

529
00:27:32,296 --> 00:27:33,960
will not only
have difficulty remarrying,

530
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:37,440
but his official career
may also be affected.

531
00:27:46,200 --> 00:27:47,920
Your Lordship, Old Madam.

532
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:49,590
A group of officials
has arrived outside.

533
00:27:49,799 --> 00:27:51,240
(Steward Fu, head steward)
They say Marquis Jing'an invited them

534
00:27:51,336 --> 00:27:52,584
(of the Yuan Residence, Biwu's father)
to preside over the separation

535
00:27:52,590 --> 00:27:53,830
of Your Lordship and the marchioness.

536
00:27:54,456 --> 00:27:56,480
Quite a few people
have gathered outside to watch.

537
00:27:56,559 --> 00:27:57,000
I...

538
00:27:57,440 --> 00:27:58,279
I had no choice.

539
00:27:58,440 --> 00:28:00,552
I could only invite them
into the residence first.

540
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:02,880
I thought Lin

541
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:05,000
was merely putting
on a show to frighten us.

542
00:28:05,192 --> 00:28:07,160
I never expected her
to truly seek a separation.

543
00:28:08,039 --> 00:28:10,359
Old Madam, what are we going to do?

544
00:28:16,140 --> 00:28:18,780
(Jiaxi Tower,
Marquis Yongchang's Residence)

545
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:36,160
Since both families
have decided on a separation,

546
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:38,880
this is

547
00:28:39,599 --> 00:28:41,200
the Lin family's Separation Agreement.

548
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:43,519
Your Lordship, please take a look.

549
00:28:43,670 --> 00:28:45,540
(Separation Agreement)
If everything is in order,

550
00:28:45,559 --> 00:28:46,519
please sign it.

551
00:28:46,520 --> 00:28:47,350
(Separation Agreement)

552
00:28:55,208 --> 00:28:57,830
I will no longer have the good fortune
to serve you, Old Madam.

553
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:01,599
I wish you good health

554
00:29:02,359 --> 00:29:03,519
and a long life.

555
00:29:15,599 --> 00:29:17,000
Third Young Lady

556
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:19,599
truly loves Your Lordship
with all her heart.

557
00:29:21,039 --> 00:29:21,599
Tell me,

558
00:29:22,640 --> 00:29:24,480
how did things ever come to this?

559
00:29:24,759 --> 00:29:27,200
How did things come to this?

560
00:29:32,160 --> 00:29:33,359
Old Madam Yuan,

561
00:29:33,359 --> 00:29:35,039
my heart

562
00:29:36,119 --> 00:29:38,480
feels as if it's being cut with a knife.

563
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:43,200
How did things really come to this?

564
00:29:46,024 --> 00:29:47,310
Must the Yuan and Lin families

565
00:29:48,759 --> 00:29:50,440
really come to this?

566
00:29:51,448 --> 00:29:52,440
We follow different ways.

567
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:54,920
It's better to part in peace

568
00:29:55,720 --> 00:29:56,960
and each seek our own path.

569
00:29:57,559 --> 00:29:58,960
You make it sound so easy.

570
00:30:00,599 --> 00:30:02,960
Today, in front of everyone,
let me ask you this.

571
00:30:03,119 --> 00:30:04,200
If one day

572
00:30:05,480 --> 00:30:07,079
you're nearly forty,

573
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:09,400
Lanxiang still has no son,

574
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:11,920
and there's no heir
to the title of Marquis Jing'an,

575
00:30:12,599 --> 00:30:13,880
will you still be able

576
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:15,590
to refuse to take a concubine?

577
00:30:28,319 --> 00:30:29,400
I stubbornly insisted

578
00:30:30,360 --> 00:30:32,110
on helping Xiulai
separate from her husband,

579
00:30:33,272 --> 00:30:35,720
and my wife helped me
bring her out of the inner residence.

580
00:30:38,319 --> 00:30:39,240
In the heavy snow,

581
00:30:40,830 --> 00:30:42,184
when I was on the verge of death,

582
00:30:43,440 --> 00:30:45,000
my wife never left my side.

583
00:30:46,079 --> 00:30:47,519
In the bitter cold,

584
00:30:48,359 --> 00:30:50,920
she stayed with me
through an entire day and night

585
00:30:53,599 --> 00:30:55,160
and even saved the whole Lin family.

586
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:57,920
My wife has shown me kindness,

587
00:30:58,839 --> 00:30:59,680
loyalty,

588
00:31:00,519 --> 00:31:01,440
and love.

589
00:31:02,839 --> 00:31:05,400
If I betrayed her for the sake of a son

590
00:31:05,400 --> 00:31:06,480
I've never even met,

591
00:31:08,720 --> 00:31:10,119
what kind of man would I be?

592
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:13,880
Even if I never have a son,

593
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:17,240
then I must have offended Heaven
in my previous life

594
00:31:17,359 --> 00:31:19,440
and made my wife suffer alongside me.

595
00:31:23,559 --> 00:31:26,480
You risked your life
for that marquis title.

596
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:28,920
You'd give it up?

597
00:31:34,039 --> 00:31:35,599
Marquis Yuan, you're mistaken.

598
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:40,440
That title

599
00:31:41,799 --> 00:31:45,079
was won with both my wife's
life and mine on the line.

600
00:31:46,079 --> 00:31:47,400
Passing it down to our descendants

601
00:31:47,880 --> 00:31:50,880
isn't so they can live off
their ancestors' achievements,

602
00:31:51,119 --> 00:31:52,359
but so they can

603
00:31:52,359 --> 00:31:55,279
remember their ancestors' glory
and strive to better themselves.

604
00:31:56,960 --> 00:31:59,519
If my wife and I never have a son,

605
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:02,559
then we'll return the title

606
00:32:04,039 --> 00:32:05,440
to the court.

607
00:32:13,880 --> 00:32:15,119
How did things

608
00:32:15,519 --> 00:32:18,160
really come to this?

609
00:32:19,119 --> 00:32:20,200
My dear sister.

610
00:32:23,608 --> 00:32:25,064
- First Madam.
- First Madam.

611
00:32:26,880 --> 00:32:27,680
Shunhua.

612
00:32:33,519 --> 00:32:34,440
My dear sister.

613
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:36,240
This is all my fault.

614
00:32:36,392 --> 00:32:37,750
I said it in the heat of the moment

615
00:32:37,944 --> 00:32:39,510
and said I wouldn't interfere anymore.

616
00:32:39,880 --> 00:32:41,440
I never imagined these youngsters

617
00:32:41,759 --> 00:32:43,039
would be so bold

618
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:44,960
as to turn a private family matter

619
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:46,599
into the talk of the entire city.

620
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:47,680
This is outrageous!

621
00:32:49,039 --> 00:32:51,160
You couldn't have come at a better time.

622
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:53,559
Please talk some sense into Xiuru.

623
00:32:53,799 --> 00:32:54,839
What married couple

624
00:32:54,839 --> 00:32:56,799
separates over a concubine?

625
00:32:57,119 --> 00:32:58,039
Exactly.

626
00:32:58,599 --> 00:32:59,599
What married couple

627
00:32:59,599 --> 00:33:01,160
separates because of a concubine?

628
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:01,720
Exactly.

629
00:33:02,039 --> 00:33:03,960
Once word gets out, everyone will think

630
00:33:04,039 --> 00:33:06,279
the Yuan family
did something disgraceful

631
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:07,920
that drove a mother

632
00:33:08,184 --> 00:33:10,310
to seek a separation
despite having four daughters.

633
00:33:16,296 --> 00:33:17,830
What nonsense are you talking about?

634
00:33:23,799 --> 00:33:25,599
I am Marquis Yongchang's mother-in-law,

635
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:26,880
and by imperial decree,

636
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:28,856
I hold the court-conferred
title of marchioness.

637
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:30,759
May I ask

638
00:33:31,119 --> 00:33:32,359
who exactly this woman is

639
00:33:32,519 --> 00:33:34,039
speaking so harshly and berating me?

640
00:33:36,839 --> 00:33:38,720
She's the wife
of the old Marquis's cousin.

641
00:33:42,400 --> 00:33:43,240
My dear sister,

642
00:33:43,839 --> 00:33:46,079
let's speak in private.

643
00:33:46,359 --> 00:33:47,799
Have them leave us.

644
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,200
All of you, go outside for now.

645
00:34:09,440 --> 00:34:10,320
Go!

646
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:23,840
My dear sister,

647
00:34:24,239 --> 00:34:26,000
I'm a straightforward person,

648
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:28,079
so I'll speak plainly.

649
00:34:29,159 --> 00:34:32,199
If you want me to persuade
Xiuru to change her mind,

650
00:34:32,719 --> 00:34:34,519
you'll have to agree
to a few conditions.

651
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:36,920
Go ahead.

652
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:38,199
First,

653
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:39,880
he may take a concubine,

654
00:34:40,519 --> 00:34:43,360
but she must be chosen
by the Lin family.

655
00:34:48,119 --> 00:34:49,000
My dear sister,

656
00:34:49,599 --> 00:34:51,039
what you want is a grandson.

657
00:34:51,079 --> 00:34:53,360
Why should it matter
which woman gives birth to him?

658
00:34:53,928 --> 00:34:56,480
If wife and concubine get along,
the household will be at peace,

659
00:34:56,559 --> 00:34:59,239
and my third son-in-law
can focus on his duties.

660
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,119
If they don't get along

661
00:35:01,240 --> 00:35:02,840
and there's trouble like this every day,

662
00:35:02,872 --> 00:35:04,936
with Ministry of War officials
showing up one moment

663
00:35:04,952 --> 00:35:06,664
and Ministry of Justice officials
the next,

664
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:07,639
my third son-in-law

665
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,679
may not be able to take much more of it.

666
00:35:19,039 --> 00:35:19,400
Fine.

667
00:35:20,199 --> 00:35:21,199
I agree.

668
00:35:22,079 --> 00:35:24,079
The Lin family can choose the concubine.

669
00:35:28,559 --> 00:35:29,199
Second,

670
00:35:30,719 --> 00:35:32,079
the Marquis's family property

671
00:35:32,248 --> 00:35:35,070
may only be divided equally among
the children of his principal wife.

672
00:35:36,199 --> 00:35:36,559
You...

673
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:40,039
You mean

674
00:35:40,920 --> 00:35:42,239
only Jiarong

675
00:35:42,639 --> 00:35:44,840
and Lin's daughters
can inherit the family property?

676
00:35:46,480 --> 00:35:49,360
The principal wife now
has four daughters.

677
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:51,000
You're right, my dear sister.

678
00:35:51,032 --> 00:35:52,940
Then the four daughters
will divide it equally.

679
00:35:53,400 --> 00:35:54,639
After all, you want a grandson

680
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,719
to inherit the marquis title.

681
00:35:57,320 --> 00:35:58,800
He'll already have the title.

682
00:35:58,810 --> 00:36:01,330
Why should he compete with his sisters
for the family property?

683
00:36:02,119 --> 00:36:03,599
What if I refuse?

684
00:36:06,639 --> 00:36:08,239
Even if I agree,

685
00:36:08,559 --> 00:36:10,519
my eldest son won't.

686
00:36:11,280 --> 00:36:12,599
He's a real firecracker.

687
00:36:12,728 --> 00:36:15,420
He was the one who urged Xiulai
to separate from her husband before.

688
00:36:15,519 --> 00:36:17,719
The case even went
to Shuntian Prefecture

689
00:36:17,840 --> 00:36:19,400
and drew His Majesty's attention.

690
00:36:19,920 --> 00:36:21,599
I simply can't control him.

691
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:23,079
Aren't you afraid

692
00:36:23,080 --> 00:36:25,352
the reputation of the Lin family's
daughters will suffer

693
00:36:25,544 --> 00:36:27,720
and make it difficult
for them to marry in the future?

694
00:36:30,480 --> 00:36:32,559
My own daughter is already married.

695
00:36:33,119 --> 00:36:34,239
As for the others,

696
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:38,400
I have enough troubles of my own.

697
00:36:38,480 --> 00:36:40,600
I can't worry about
what happens to everyone else.

698
00:36:41,719 --> 00:36:44,679
Your Lin family has gone too far.

699
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:56,440
Old Madam Yuan,
you have a broad forehead

700
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:58,079
and full earlobes.

701
00:36:58,312 --> 00:37:00,230
Those features promise
many blessed descendants.

702
00:37:00,328 --> 00:37:02,280
I'm sure you'll have
more than one grandson.

703
00:37:03,880 --> 00:37:05,239
Xiuru is still young.

704
00:37:05,840 --> 00:37:07,599
She may well have a son in the future.

705
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:11,980
Since the principal wife's children
will divide the family property equally,

706
00:37:12,199 --> 00:37:14,440
a son would naturally
receive his share as well.

707
00:37:19,760 --> 00:37:21,280
Search your conscience and tell me,

708
00:37:22,239 --> 00:37:24,280
how can there be such a rule

709
00:37:24,719 --> 00:37:27,079
that daughters
inherit the family property?

710
00:37:27,512 --> 00:37:28,280
Old Madam Yuan,

711
00:37:28,328 --> 00:37:30,670
the idea that daughters
cannot inherit family property

712
00:37:30,679 --> 00:37:32,119
has never been an unalterable rule

713
00:37:32,199 --> 00:37:33,679
since ancient times.

714
00:37:34,239 --> 00:37:35,199
During the Han dynasty,

715
00:37:35,240 --> 00:37:37,368
daughters could not only
inherit family property,

716
00:37:37,599 --> 00:37:38,960
but even noble titles.

717
00:37:40,719 --> 00:37:42,000
How could that be possible?

718
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:43,559
Why wouldn't it be?

719
00:37:44,719 --> 00:37:47,760
Even if you don't know there were
titled noblewomen in the Han dynasty,

720
00:37:47,920 --> 00:37:48,679
surely you know

721
00:37:48,904 --> 00:37:50,776
there was a female emperor
in the Tang dynasty.

722
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:53,079
No matter how persuasively you put it,

723
00:37:53,599 --> 00:37:55,440
I cannot agree to let daughters

724
00:37:55,960 --> 00:37:57,190
inherit the family property.

725
00:37:57,639 --> 00:37:58,280
I agree.

726
00:38:18,760 --> 00:38:19,199
Mother.

727
00:38:20,159 --> 00:38:21,400
If the boy proves capable,

728
00:38:21,464 --> 00:38:23,112
he'll already have the marquis title.

729
00:38:23,400 --> 00:38:25,519
Building a fortune
of his own won't be difficult.

730
00:38:26,159 --> 00:38:27,239
If he proves incapable,

731
00:38:27,760 --> 00:38:28,800
forget the family property.

732
00:38:29,199 --> 00:38:31,480
He may not even
be able to keep the title.

733
00:38:31,976 --> 00:38:33,840
My daughters
are my own flesh and blood, too,

734
00:38:34,072 --> 00:38:35,550
and they carry the Yuan bloodline.

735
00:38:36,728 --> 00:38:38,710
I'm willing to leave
the family property to them

736
00:38:39,048 --> 00:38:40,800
so they can live
their lives in security.

737
00:38:58,440 --> 00:38:59,239
My dear sister,

738
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:04,280
no one can have everything
go their way in life.

739
00:39:05,039 --> 00:39:08,079
Each side giving a little
is already the best outcome.

740
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:09,960
You get your grandson,

741
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:11,800
and their family stays together.

742
00:39:15,119 --> 00:39:15,920
Why

743
00:39:16,519 --> 00:39:18,320
force a loving couple

744
00:39:18,320 --> 00:39:19,960
to be torn apart

745
00:39:20,648 --> 00:39:21,630
and leave the children

746
00:39:22,199 --> 00:39:23,440
without their mother?

747
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:34,920
I'm old now.

748
00:39:36,712 --> 00:39:37,592
As for this matter,

749
00:39:38,480 --> 00:39:39,800
I'll leave the decision to you.

750
00:40:05,340 --> 00:40:10,820
♪Time unfurls a long scroll♪

751
00:40:11,416 --> 00:40:13,460
This is the document dividing
the family property.

752
00:40:13,760 --> 00:40:14,840
Please take a look, Shaohui.

753
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,480
If you have no objections,

754
00:40:16,648 --> 00:40:18,110
the neighborhood headman here

755
00:40:18,519 --> 00:40:19,760
can serve as your witness.

756
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:21,000
Sign it.

757
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:23,490
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

758
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:26,039
All right.

759
00:40:26,039 --> 00:40:29,540
♪Each plant endures
its own trials before reaching shore♪

760
00:40:29,780 --> 00:40:33,020
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

761
00:40:33,020 --> 00:40:36,060
♪Only orchids dwell
in secluded places♪

762
00:40:36,420 --> 00:40:41,820
♪Watching the old and new
take turns in this world♪

763
00:40:41,820 --> 00:40:46,519
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

764
00:40:46,519 --> 00:40:47,920
I've put you through a lot today.

765
00:40:50,376 --> 00:40:52,424
What you said today
at the Yuan Residence

766
00:40:52,599 --> 00:40:54,039
in front of everyone...

767
00:40:55,768 --> 00:40:57,710
It may have come out
in the heat of my exchange

768
00:40:57,840 --> 00:40:58,880
with Chengze,

769
00:40:59,320 --> 00:41:01,000
but I meant every word.

770
00:41:03,519 --> 00:41:04,760
I swear that in this life,

771
00:41:05,304 --> 00:41:06,710
I will never take a concubine.

772
00:41:07,559 --> 00:41:08,280
My only wish

773
00:41:09,599 --> 00:41:10,840
is to hold your hand

774
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,519
and grow old with you.

775
00:41:19,519 --> 00:41:20,320
Careful.

776
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:22,020
(All afflictions arise from ignorance)

777
00:41:28,152 --> 00:41:29,070
- Mother.
- Mother.

778
00:41:29,960 --> 00:41:31,519
Shaohui has signed it?

779
00:41:32,679 --> 00:41:33,360
He's signed it.

780
00:41:38,599 --> 00:41:39,760
Have your wife

781
00:41:40,280 --> 00:41:41,440
sit down and join us.

782
00:41:42,719 --> 00:41:43,960
Thank you for the seat, Mother.

783
00:41:45,800 --> 00:41:46,280
Come.

784
00:41:57,639 --> 00:41:58,480
Tell me,

785
00:41:58,960 --> 00:42:00,719
when did you figure it out?

786
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:05,400
I sensed something was strange
from the very beginning that day,

787
00:42:05,719 --> 00:42:07,239
but I couldn't figure out why.

788
00:42:08,239 --> 00:42:10,000
Then Mother swept out in anger,

789
00:42:10,199 --> 00:42:11,320
and I understood.

790
00:42:11,840 --> 00:42:13,199
Mother wanted us

791
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:14,800
to be Xiuru's blade

792
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:16,880
and force the Yuan family to yield.

793
00:42:20,079 --> 00:42:22,079
You really are a clever one.

794
00:42:23,239 --> 00:42:24,719
Lanxiang and I talked it over.

795
00:42:25,079 --> 00:42:26,800
When Xiuru was still unmarried,

796
00:42:26,872 --> 00:42:29,500
she already had the courage to seek
a better marriage for herself.

797
00:42:29,688 --> 00:42:31,880
She was never someone
who would lose herself in love.

798
00:42:32,719 --> 00:42:35,719
What she feared
wasn't Chengze taking a concubine,

799
00:42:36,159 --> 00:42:37,480
but the Yuan clansmen

800
00:42:37,624 --> 00:42:40,610
using a son born to a concubine to take
control of the Marquis's household.

801
00:42:41,360 --> 00:42:42,679
Then Xiuru and her daughters

802
00:42:42,800 --> 00:42:44,880
would be left at the mercy of others,

803
00:42:44,920 --> 00:42:47,890
forced to watch their every expression
and tread carefully just to survive.

804
00:42:48,360 --> 00:42:50,960
I knew Xiuru understood
what was at stake,

805
00:42:51,760 --> 00:42:53,679
so I showed her a way forward.

806
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:57,079
You two

807
00:42:58,400 --> 00:43:00,760
shouldn't blame her
for going to such lengths.

808
00:43:05,100 --> 00:43:07,580
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

809
00:43:08,159 --> 00:43:09,360
Fainted! Unconscious now!

810
00:43:09,960 --> 00:43:10,599
Come here!

811
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:11,840
Hurry over here!

812
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:12,400
Come on!

813
00:43:12,840 --> 00:43:14,159
Quick, press the philtrum!

814
00:43:14,480 --> 00:43:14,920
Over here!

815
00:43:16,440 --> 00:43:17,320
Quick, come here!

816
00:43:17,639 --> 00:43:18,880
Hurry over here!

817
00:43:25,300 --> 00:43:27,770
- Mother and daughter are safe!
- Mother and daughter are safe!

818
00:43:27,784 --> 00:43:29,360
Wonderful!

819
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:32,400
- Mother and daughter are safe!
- Mother and daughter are safe!

820
00:43:32,400 --> 00:43:33,144
The baby's born!

821
00:43:50,380 --> 00:43:54,500
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

822
00:43:57,340 --> 00:44:01,860
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

823
00:44:03,140 --> 00:44:07,060
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

824
00:44:07,740 --> 00:44:10,500
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

825
00:44:11,220 --> 00:44:13,540
♪Though all the world may fade♪

826
00:44:13,540 --> 00:44:16,620
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

827
00:44:18,140 --> 00:44:22,380
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

828
00:44:25,300 --> 00:44:29,460
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

829
00:44:31,260 --> 00:44:34,820
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

830
00:44:34,820 --> 00:44:38,380
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

831
00:44:39,180 --> 00:44:44,860
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

832
00:44:45,220 --> 00:44:49,540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

